!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Biopsies were snap-frozen in liquid nitrogen, stored at -80°C.  At processing the biopsy samples were homogenized while still frozen and total RNA isolation was performed using RNeasy kit protocol (Qiagen, Chatsworth, Ca, USA).
!Sample_label_ch1 = biotin
!Sample_label_protocol_ch1 = Procedure used standard Affymetrix protocol.
!Sample_hyb_protocol = Procedure used standard Affymetrix protocol.
!Sample_scan_protocol = Procedure used standard Affymetrix protocol.
!Sample_description = 4874.NN
!Sample_data_processing = The raw data from 180 microarrays were processed using the Robust Multichip Average (RMA) method. The expression values in the table were after adjustment of RMA expression values (on the log scale) to account for batch and sex effects.
