!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = uninvolved skin from cases
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Two biopsies were taken from each patient; one 6mm punch biopsy was obtained from lesional skin of each patient (involved sample) and the other from non-lesional skin (uninvolved sample), taken at least 10 cm away from any active plaque. One biopsy was obtained from each healty control. The non-lesional and control biopsies were taken from the buttocks or upper thighs.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Biopsies were snap-frozen in liquid nitrogen, stored at -80°C.  At processing the biopsy samples were homogenized while still frozen and total RNA isolation was performed using RNeasy kit protocol (Qiagen, Chatsworth, Ca, USA).
!Sample_label_ch1 = biotin
!Sample_label_protocol_ch1 = Procedure used standard Affymetrix protocol.
!Sample_hyb_protocol = Procedure used standard Affymetrix protocol.
!Sample_scan_protocol = Procedure used standard Affymetrix protocol.
